            <ArticleTitle>Changes of the kinetics of calcium washout from dog heart after ischaemia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>260-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The kinetics of myocardial calcium washout using a calcium free perfusion were studied in controls and animals after a short period of ischaemia. A significantly higher rate for k3 was found after ischaemia. This may represent a greater lability of membrane-bound calcium.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
